WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.133 --> 00:00:00.467
Well, for

00:00:00.467 --> 00:00:01.568
three days,

00:00:01.568 --> 00:00:02.902
Chinese ships

00:00:02.902 --> 00:00:04.404
and planes have been buzzing around

00:00:04.404 --> 00:00:06.072
Taiwan and military exercises

00:00:06.072 --> 00:00:08.541
that have raised tensions in the region.

00:00:08.908 --> 00:00:11.177
China now says the exercises are over.

00:00:11.344 --> 00:00:12.312
The first time ever,

00:00:12.312 --> 00:00:14.014
it appeared to include a simulation

00:00:14.014 --> 00:00:16.049
of a Chinese aircraft carrier

00:00:16.049 --> 00:00:18.351
carrying out strikes on Taiwan.

00:00:18.385 --> 00:00:20.787
More from CNN's Selena One.

00:00:22.589 --> 00:00:23.456
China launched

00:00:23.456 --> 00:00:25.725
three days of military exercises

00:00:25.725 --> 00:00:26.726
around Taiwan

00:00:26.726 --> 00:00:27.594
after the island's

00:00:27.594 --> 00:00:29.796
president met the US House speaker

00:00:29.796 --> 00:00:31.731
China's military said the drills create

00:00:31.731 --> 00:00:33.333
an all around encirclement

00:00:33.333 --> 00:00:34.334
of the island

00:00:34.334 --> 00:00:35.168
and simulate

00:00:35.168 --> 00:00:37.470
precision attacks on key targets.

00:00:37.771 --> 00:00:39.572
In reaction to the military, drills,

00:00:39.572 --> 00:00:41.574
Taiwan's Ministry of Foreign Affairs said

00:00:41.608 --> 00:00:42.575
China's, quote,

00:00:42.575 --> 00:00:44.010
provocative measures

00:00:44.010 --> 00:00:45.345
have clearly challenged

00:00:45.345 --> 00:00:46.780
the international order,

00:00:46.780 --> 00:00:47.781
undermine peace

00:00:47.781 --> 00:00:49.582
and stability of the Taiwan Strait

00:00:49.582 --> 00:00:51.151
and the region.

00:00:51.818 --> 00:00:53.219
China's fighter jets

00:00:53.219 --> 00:00:55.188
fly around Taiwan skies.

00:00:55.188 --> 00:00:57.390
Military ships sail off its coast.

00:00:57.690 --> 00:00:59.092
China says it's simulating

00:00:59.092 --> 00:01:01.127
precision attacks on key

00:01:01.127 --> 00:01:02.662
targets in Taiwan.

00:01:02.662 --> 00:01:05.265
So while Beijing has not launched

00:01:05.265 --> 00:01:06.032
any missiles,

00:01:06.032 --> 00:01:06.866
its military

00:01:06.866 --> 00:01:08.568
released this animation

00:01:08.568 --> 00:01:08.902
showing

00:01:08.902 --> 00:01:10.870
missiles fired from land, sea

00:01:10.870 --> 00:01:12.772
and air into Taiwan.

00:01:12.772 --> 00:01:14.974
Two of them explode in flames.

00:01:16.242 --> 00:01:18.244
Beijing is showing the world its fury

00:01:18.411 --> 00:01:18.978
launching

00:01:18.978 --> 00:01:21.448
three days of military exercises

00:01:21.448 --> 00:01:22.749
around Taiwan

00:01:22.749 --> 00:01:23.616
after the island's

00:01:23.616 --> 00:01:25.819
president, Tsai Ing wen met with U.S.

00:01:25.819 --> 00:01:26.386
House Speaker

00:01:26.386 --> 00:01:29.089
Kevin McCarthy in California.

00:01:29.089 --> 00:01:30.123
For the first time,

00:01:30.123 --> 00:01:31.057
it appears Chinese

00:01:31.057 --> 00:01:32.258
simulated strikes

00:01:32.258 --> 00:01:33.359
with warplanes

00:01:33.359 --> 00:01:35.395
that took off from an aircraft carrier.

00:01:36.329 --> 00:01:38.331
This video shows Taiwan's coast guard

00:01:38.331 --> 00:01:40.467
confronting a Chinese ship.

00:01:40.467 --> 00:01:41.101
The Taiwanese

00:01:41.101 --> 00:01:42.669
sailor says you were now

00:01:42.669 --> 00:01:44.671
seriously damaging regional peace,

00:01:44.771 --> 00:01:46.606
stability and safety.

00:01:46.606 --> 00:01:48.108
Please turn around immediately.

00:01:48.108 --> 00:01:50.510
And leave if you keep proceeding forward.

00:01:50.643 --> 00:01:53.379
I will take eviction measures.

00:01:53.379 --> 00:01:54.314
The encounter

00:01:54.314 --> 00:01:55.482
highlighting the risks

00:01:55.482 --> 00:01:56.983
of any miscalculation

00:01:56.983 --> 00:01:59.452
in the Taiwan Street.

00:01:59.519 --> 00:02:02.088
Beijing sees democratically ruled Taiwan

00:02:02.088 --> 00:02:03.723
as a part of its territory

00:02:03.723 --> 00:02:05.658
that will eventually be reunified

00:02:05.658 --> 00:02:07.160
with the mainland

00:02:07.160 --> 00:02:08.061
Chinese military

00:02:08.061 --> 00:02:09.496
said the drills are, quote,

00:02:09.496 --> 00:02:11.531
a serious warning against the Taiwan

00:02:11.531 --> 00:02:13.133
separatist forces, collusion

00:02:13.133 --> 00:02:14.701
with external forces,

00:02:14.701 --> 00:02:16.569
and a necessary move to defend

00:02:16.569 --> 00:02:17.670
national sovereignty.

00:02:18.838 --> 00:02:19.973
Experts say Beijing

00:02:19.973 --> 00:02:20.940
is normalizing

00:02:20.940 --> 00:02:22.976
military activity around the island.

00:02:23.209 --> 00:02:25.178
It already sent military jets

00:02:25.178 --> 00:02:25.778
and ships

00:02:25.778 --> 00:02:26.713
around Taiwan

00:02:26.713 --> 00:02:29.015
every day on China's heavily

00:02:29.015 --> 00:02:30.517
censored social media.

00:02:30.517 --> 00:02:31.818
Some are commenting that

00:02:31.818 --> 00:02:33.853
the drills do not go far enough.

00:02:34.187 --> 00:02:36.656
One writes, Let's just take Taiwan.

00:02:36.856 --> 00:02:37.891
Another says,

00:02:37.891 --> 00:02:39.392
If you're not going to attack,

00:02:39.392 --> 00:02:41.461
then don't waste taxpayer money.

00:02:42.028 --> 00:02:42.929
Well, then U.S.

00:02:42.929 --> 00:02:44.364
House Speaker Nancy Pelosi

00:02:44.364 --> 00:02:46.132
visited Taiwan last summer.

00:02:46.132 --> 00:02:46.533
China

00:02:46.533 --> 00:02:48.301
responded with military drills

00:02:48.301 --> 00:02:50.403
that simulated a blockade.

00:02:50.403 --> 00:02:51.604
For the first time,

00:02:51.604 --> 00:02:52.972
China even fired

00:02:52.972 --> 00:02:55.008
missiles over the island.

00:02:55.008 --> 00:02:56.943
Experts say the military response to

00:02:56.943 --> 00:02:58.912
this time is more restrained

00:02:58.912 --> 00:03:00.046
because the meeting between

00:03:00.046 --> 00:03:01.181
Tai and McCarthy

00:03:01.181 --> 00:03:03.082
was held on American soil

00:03:03.082 --> 00:03:04.884
to avoid provoking Beijing.

00:03:04.884 --> 00:03:06.319
Today, I am honored both Washington

00:03:06.319 --> 00:03:07.854
and Taipei have called the visit

00:03:07.854 --> 00:03:09.956
just an ordinary transit stop.

00:03:10.356 --> 00:03:12.525
But the symbolism was undeniable.

00:03:12.792 --> 00:03:15.895
We are stronger when we are together

00:03:16.396 --> 00:03:18.398
with Washington's support for Taipei

00:03:18.398 --> 00:03:19.599
only growing.

00:03:19.599 --> 00:03:22.769
Beijing's anger will only intensify.

00:03:23.403 --> 00:03:24.337
On China's third

00:03:24.337 --> 00:03:26.239
day of military exercises around

00:03:26.239 --> 00:03:28.741
Taiwan, the US Navy sent a destroyer

00:03:28.741 --> 00:03:29.776
close to a contested

00:03:29.776 --> 00:03:31.477
island to the South China Sea.

00:03:31.477 --> 00:03:32.378
Now, Beijing claims

00:03:32.378 --> 00:03:33.413
the island is theirs

00:03:33.413 --> 00:03:34.714
and called the move illegal.

00:03:34.714 --> 00:03:35.615
Meanwhile, the U.S.

00:03:35.615 --> 00:03:36.616
says it can operate

00:03:36.616 --> 00:03:38.885
wherever international law allows.

00:03:38.885 --> 00:03:40.353
So it's not just Taiwan,

00:03:40.353 --> 00:03:41.354
but the South China Sea

00:03:41.354 --> 00:03:42.722
is another source of tensions

00:03:42.722 --> 00:03:44.390
between the US and China.

00:03:44.390 --> 00:03:46.159
And with these latest exercises,

00:03:46.159 --> 00:03:47.327
around Taiwan,

00:03:47.327 --> 00:03:48.428
experts say China's

00:03:48.428 --> 00:03:49.829
military is flexing

00:03:49.829 --> 00:03:51.130
its military might,

00:03:51.130 --> 00:03:51.965
showing the world

00:03:51.965 --> 00:03:53.132
that it has the ability

00:03:53.132 --> 00:03:54.601
to conduct blockade

00:03:54.601 --> 00:03:55.268
and missile

00:03:55.268 --> 00:03:58.504
strikes on targets in and around Taiwan.

00:03:58.805 --> 00:04:00.807
Charlene Wang, CNN, Beijing.

